AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0000837> "A disease that has its basis in the disruption of bone resorption. Bone resorption is a process in which specialized cells known as osteoclasts degrade the organic and inorganic portions of bone, and endocytose and transport the degradation products.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0000837> "bone resorption disease")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0000837> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0000833>)

