# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005626> (epithelial neoplasm)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005626> "A benign or malignant neoplasm that arises from and is composed of epithelial cells. This category include adenomas, papillomas, and carcinomas.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005626> "epithelial neoplasm")
