AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005627> "A primary or metastatic malignant neoplasm affecting the head and neck. Representative examples include oral cavity squamous cell carcinoma, laryngeal squamous cell carcinoma, and salivary gland carcinoma.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005627> "head and neck cancer")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005627> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004992>)
