# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005707> (coccidiosis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005707> "A parasitic infection caused by Coccidia. It affects livestock, birds and humans. In humans the parasite infests the intestinal tract and may cause watery diarrhea, abdominal pain, fever, nausea and vomiting.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005707> "coccidiosis")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005707> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0002428>)

