# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011057> (cerebrovascular disorder)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011057> "A disorder resulting from inadequate blood flow in the vessels that supply the brain. Representative examples include cerebrovascular ischemia, cerebral embolism, and cerebral infarction.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011057> "cerebrovascular disorder")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011057> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0005560>)
