AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021058> "A broad classification for disorders in which the development of neoplasms typically occur in association with a characteristic set of signs or symptoms. These disorders may be inherited or acquired.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021058> "neoplastic syndrome")
