AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021063> "A primary or metastatic malignant neoplasm that affects the colon. Representative examples include carcinoma, lymphoma, and sarcoma.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021063> "malignant colon neoplasm")
