# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021094> (immunodeficiency disease)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021094> "Disease in which there is a deficiency or defect in the mechanisms of immunity, either cellular or humoral.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021094> "immunodeficiency syndrome")
