# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100087> (familial Alzheimer disease)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100087> "A degenerative disease of the brain that causes gradual loss of memory, judgment, and the ability to function socially. About 25% of all Alzheimer disease is familial (more than 2 people in a family have AD). When Alzheimer disease begins before 60 or 65 years of age (early-onset AD) about 60% of the cases are familial (also known as Early-onset familial AD). These cases appear to be inherited in an autosomal dominant manner.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100087> "familial Alzheimer disease")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100087> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0004975>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100087> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0015547>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100087> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0024237>)

