# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100163> (COVID-19–associated multisystem inflammatory syndrome in children)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100163> "A inflammatory syndrome in children infected by the SARS-CoV-2 with similarities to Kawasaki disease. Clinical manifestations range from fever and inflammation to myocardial injury, shock, and development of coronary artery aneurysms.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100163> "COVID-19–associated multisystem inflammatory syndrome in children")
