# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_7770011> (disease by molecular mechanism)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_7770011> "A grouping class for human diseases classified by their underlying molecular or pathophysiological mechanism, such as protein aggregation, ion channel dysfunction, or signal transduction disruption.")
